281A DD80             ( demo/circles.asm):00074                         STD     <BALLX
281C CC0201           ( demo/circles.asm):00075                         LDD     #$0201          ; ... moving right 2, down 1
281F DD82             ( demo/circles.asm):00076                         STD     <BALLDX
2821 0F84             ( demo/circles.asm):00077                         CLR     <PHASE
